00:05:26.325 --> 00:05:30.263
to implement a reopening,

00:05:30.263 --> 00:05:33.232
and a very powerful
reopening plan,

00:05:33.232 --> 00:05:35.067
of their state,

00:05:35.067 --> 00:05:39.538
at a time and in a manner
as most appropriate.

00:05:39.538 --> 00:05:41.640
-You can't authorize people
to do something

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:43.042
they already have
the authority to do.

00:05:43.042 --> 00:05:44.910
He's like a boss who thinks
he's being generous

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:47.813
by telling his employees, "Hey,
when your shift ends tonight,

00:05:47.813 --> 00:05:48.881
feel free to, you know,

00:05:48.881 --> 00:05:50.949
go home to your families,
or whatever.

00:05:50.949 --> 00:05:54.387
I give you the permission
to do that."

00:05:54.387 --> 00:05:57.256
Governors across the country,
and the political spectrum,

00:05:57.256 --> 00:06:00.092
from California Governor
Gavin Newsom, a Democrat;

00:06:00.092 --> 00:06:02.595
to Ohio Governor Mike DeWine,
a Republican;

00:06:02.595 --> 00:06:04.029
