to the Olive Garden?

00:07:01.153 --> 00:07:02.922
"That's right, pass
the breadsticks around.

00:07:02.922 --> 00:07:04.857
Everybody touch the basket.

00:07:04.857 --> 00:07:07.926
Everybody
touch the basket!

00:07:07.926 --> 00:07:11.229
You just can't make people go
to restaurants or stores

00:07:11.229 --> 00:07:12.865
