00:07:12.865 --> 00:07:14.867
In fact, a new poll,
published by Politico this week,

00:07:14.867 --> 00:07:16.035
found that...

00:07:32.752 --> 00:07:34.387
When it comes
to reopening the economy,

00:07:34.387 --> 00:07:35.955
voters want the government
