called "Hobbs &amp; SARS"?

00:11:14.706 --> 00:11:16.208
Although, it would explain why,

00:11:16.208 --> 00:11:18.477
when it comes to putting people
in charge of the government,

00:11:18.477 --> 00:11:19.944
Trump's motto is...

00:11:19.944 --> 00:11:22.080
-I don't have friends.

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:23.882
I got family.

00:11:23.882 --> 00:11:25.050
-Okay.
I take it back.

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:27.686
You can do
a Trump miniseries now,

00:11:27.686 --> 00:11:30.789
only if Vin Diesel plays him.

00:11:30.789 --> 00:11:32.691
[ As Diesel ] The president
of the United States

00:11:32.691 --> 00:11:34.359
has the authority to do

00:11:34.359 --> 00:11:38.097
what the president
has the authority to do.

00:11:38.097 --> 00:11:40.399
And all of this just reveals

00:11:40.399 --> 00:11:43.702
the rot of bad faith
at the core of the modern GOP.

00:11:43.702 --> 00:11:45.304
Conservatives
never really meant

00:11:45.304 --> 00:11:47.072
any of that stuff
about limited government.

00:11:47.072 --> 00:11:49.107
As we're seeing now, in fact,
Trump himself conveniently

00:11:49.107 --> 00:11:51.476
changes his mind
whenever it suits him

00:11:51.476 --> 00:11:52.678
and the whole GOP

00:11:52.678 --> 00:11:54.346
turns in unison with him
like school of herring.

00:11:54.346 --> 00:11:56.715
When he wanted to claim
absolute power,

00:11:56.715 --> 00:11:59.317
he insisted that the president
calls the shots.

00:11:59.317 --> 00:12:01.420
But when he was asked
about the failures

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:03.222
at the federal level
to ramp up testing

00:12:03.222 --> 00:12:04.556
or when governors
were begging him

00:12:04.556 --> 00:12:05.658
for life-saving equipment,

00:12:05.658 --> 00:12:07.559
like ventilators
and protective gear,

00:12:07.559 --> 00:12:09.194
he said he didn't
take responsibility

00:12:09.194 --> 00:12:10.762
and actually bragged

00:12:10.762 --> 00:12:12.798
that he wouldn't even call
the governors,

00:12:12.798 --> 00:12:14.132
unless they praised him.

00:12:14.132 --> 00:12:16.268
-Dr. Fauci said,
earlier this week,

00:12:16.268 --> 00:12:19.371
that the lag in testing was,
in fact, a failing.

00:12:19.371 --> 00:12:21.573
Do you take responsibility
for that

00:12:21.573 --> 00:12:24.676
and when can you guarantee
that every single American

00:12:24.676 --> 00:12:27.512
who needs a test
will be able to have a test?

00:12:27.512 --> 00:12:28.947
What's the date of that?

00:12:28.947 --> 00:12:31.250
-Yeah. No, I don't take
responsibility at all.

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:32.584
He calls all the governors.

00:12:32.584 --> 00:12:34.186
I tell him. I mean,
I'm a different type of person.

00:12:34.186 --> 00:12:36.889
I say, "Mike, don't call
the governor of Washington.

00:12:36.889 --> 00:12:38.457
You're wasting your time
with him.

00:12:38.457 --> 00:12:40.959
Don't call the woman
in Michigan."

00:12:40.959 --> 00:12:42.862
-Okay, first of all,
she has a name --

00:12:42.862 --> 00:12:45.431
it's Gretchen Whitmer --
and she's a governor.

00:12:45.431 --> 00:12:47.032
On top from being
a sexist [bleep]

00:12:47.032 --> 00:12:49.634
Trump's brain is so deteriorated
that he talks about governors

00:12:49.634 --> 00:12:51.403
the way your dad talks
about an actress

00:12:51.403 --> 00:12:53.471
he recognizes, but can't name.

00:12:53.471 --> 00:12:55.173
"Who's the one who was

00:12:55.173 --> 00:12:57.309
in the movie...
with the guy --"

00:12:57.309 --> 00:12:59.278
Diane Lane, Dad.

00:12:59.278 --> 00:13:00.812
It's always Diane Lane.

00:13:00.812 --> 00:13:04.016
Look, we can't just open
the economy up by May 1st.

00:13:04.016 --> 00:13:05.984
Not only does Trump not have
the power to do that,

00:13:05.984 --> 00:13:08.120
but public health experts
are warning

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:10.722
that we won't be able
to just go back to normal

00:13:10.722 --> 00:13:13.425
until there's mass testing;
contact tracing;

00:13:13.425 --> 00:13:14.927
and, eventually, a vaccine.

00:13:14.927 --> 00:13:16.128
A responsible president

00:13:16.128 --> 00:13:17.696
would be preparing the nation
for that reality.

00:13:17.696 --> 00:13:20.933
Instead, Trump is, once again,
trying to wave away the crisis.

00:13:20.933 --> 00:13:23.301
As polls show,
people just don't believe him

00:13:23.301 --> 00:13:24.403
and that's because...

00:13:24.403 --> 00:13:26.371
-We don't wanna be
the suckers anymore.

00:13:26.371 --> 00:13:30.109
-This has been "A Closer Look"
and this, one more time,

00:13:30.109 --> 00:13:33.211
is my Paul Giamatti impression
from "John Adams."

00:13:33.211 --> 00:13:35.147
[ Grumbling ]

00:13:35.147 --> 00:13:37.249
Abigail, I am

00:13:37.249 --> 00:13:38.384
vexed.

00:13:41.119 --> 00:13:45.324
♪♪

00:13:45.324 --> 00:13:48.460 line:0%
City Harvest is New York City's
largest food rescue organization

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:51.262 line:0%
and, now, they're working hard
to support local families

00:13:51.262 --> 00:13:54.032 line:0%
who are out of work due
to the COVID-19 pandemic.

00:13:54.032 --> 00:13:56.868 line:0%
If you're watching this online,
please hit the donate button.

00:13:56.868 --> 00:13:57.936 line:0%
Stay safe.

00:13:57.936 --> 00:13:59.138 line:0%
Wash your hands.

00:13:59.138 --> 00:14:00.372 line:0%
We love you.

